This repository documents two cats, an iPhone app for splitting shared expenses
(https://twocats.sbarro.dev/). The text, diagrams and images here are published
so that people can read about how the app is built. They may be read, linked to
and quoted briefly with attribution. No other right is granted: the contents may
not be copied, redistributed, modified or used to make derivative works without
written permission from the copyright holder.

The two cats name, the pixel cats, the app icon and the screenshots are part of
the app's identity and are not licensed for reuse.
